{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have you read any of Gogol's books?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now imagine that you will have a chance to visit his worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To meet the collegiate assessor Kovalev or to communicate with Chichikov?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our project will give you such an opportunity through the prism of a fourteen-year-old girl's terrible dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dream is a nightmare based on one of the books of classic writers. And only by overcoming them, the girl will be able to overcome her personal problems, fears and feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/na_gif2.gif?t=1744612142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player will have his own \u2018base\u2019, which will change from passing nightmares. This is a girl's room from the 80's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travelling through the nightmares, the player will have to solve puzzles, escape and hide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/na_gif1__1_.gif?t=1744612142\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Each nightmare is unique in its own way and is filled with motives of one of the writer's books. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like the project, we will release additions based on other books and writers. Nightmares are different, and we have already collected a lot of ideas for their realisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each nightmare is a metamorphosis of episodes from a girl's life.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422840?t=1744612142","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744612142","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/aa4a9ca89b10cc1d61099c8014dd8acda524f7c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744612142","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/aa4a9ca89b10cc1d61099c8014dd8acda524f7c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744612142","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features violent scenes, blood, dead people, and brutality."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have you read any of Gogol's books?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now imagine that you will have a chance to visit his worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To meet the collegiate assessor Kovalev or to communicate with Chichikov?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our project will give you such an opportunity through the prism of a fourteen-year-old girl's terrible dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dream is a nightmare based on one of the books of classic writers. And only by overcoming them, the girl will be able to overcome her personal problems, fears and feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/na_gif2.gif?t=1744612142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player will have his own \u2018base\u2019, which will change from passing nightmares. This is a girl's room from the 80's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travelling through the nightmares, the player will have to solve puzzles, escape and hide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/na_gif1__1_.gif?t=1744612142\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Each nightmare is unique in its own way and is filled with motives of one of the writer's books. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like the project, we will release additions based on other books and writers. Nightmares are different, and we have already collected a lot of ideas for their realisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each nightmare is a metamorphosis of episodes from a girl's life.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Antelus Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/header.jpg?t=1744612142","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118082,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118082/movie480.mp4?t=1742835711","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118082/movie_max.mp4?t=1742835711"},"name":"\u0422\u0440\u0435\u0439\u043b\u0435\u0440 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118082/6e3da60e7a241de45395ebe76ed8a4b4a5c2d6da/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742835711","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118082/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742835711","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118082/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742835711"}}],"name":"Nightmares Awake","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200\uff0fIntel Core i3-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 560 4GB / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br><